OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785847716
OL,3,CUniversities of Kent and Greenwich
OL,4,Cmerge to create 'super-university'
OL,6,FThe universities of Kent and Greenwich
OL,7,Fhave merged into the UK's first "super-
OL,8,Funiversity".
OL,10,FThe new London and South East
OL,11,FUniversity Group - to be known as LASE
OL,12,F- has become the third largest
OL,13,Funiversity in the UK.
OL,15,FIt has more than 50,000 students and
OL,16,Ffour campuses across London, Medway
OL,17,Fand Kent.
OL,26,@oD@aOUpD@KO]
