OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785847716
OL,3,CUniversities of Kent and Greenwich
OL,4,Cmerge to create 'super-university'
OL,6,FThe higher education institutions
OL,7,Fannounced plans to merge in September
OL,8,Flast year and an official launch will
OL,9,Ftake place on September 7, exactly one
OL,10,Fyear on.
OL,12,FThe two universities will still
OL,13,Foperate as distinct academic divisions
OL,14,Fwithin the university group, retaining
OL,15,Ftheir current names.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
