CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785847716
OL,3,CUniversities of Kent and Greenwich
OL,4,Cmerge to create 'super-university'
OL,6,FStudents will still apply to and
OL,7,Fgraduate from the institution they
OL,8,Fchoose.It comes as universities in the
OL,9,FUK have been facing increasing
OL,10,Ffinancial pressures, with MPs on the
OL,11,FEducation Committee warning earlier
OL,12,Fthis year that there is a "real risk"
OL,13,Fa university in England could close
OL,14,Fdue to insolvency for the first time.
OL,26,@tD@[OUtD@eO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
