PN,38704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785847716
OL,3,CUniversities of Kent and Greenwich
OL,4,Cmerge to create 'super-university'
OL,6,FThe Office for Students (OfS), the
OL,7,Fhigher education regulator in England,
OL,8,Ftold the committee that it fears 24
OL,9,Fproviders are at risk of becoming
OL,10,Finsolvent and closing in the 12 months
OL,11,Ffrom November last year, and warned
OL,12,F45% of higher education providers
OL,13,Fcould be facing a deficit for 2025/26.
OL,15,FThe universities of Kent Greenwich
OL,16,Fsaid previously that their merged
OL,17,Fgroup will provide a strong financial
OL,18,Ffoundation for getting through
OL,19,Feconomic challenges and would be a
OL,20,F"blueprint for others to follow".
OL,26,@|D@AOU|D@`O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/7
