CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785847716
OL,3,CUniversities of Kent and Greenwich
OL,4,Cmerge to create 'super-university'
OL,6,FUniversity of Greenwich vice-
OL,7,Fchancellor and new chief executive of
OL,8,FLASE Professor Jane Harrington said:
OL,9,F"There has been tireless work over the
OL,10,Flast year working to an ambitious
OL,11,Ftimetable and developing a new
OL,12,Funiversity model that has never been
OL,13,Fdone before.
OL,15,F"It means we are starting with a
OL,16,Fsmooth transition, an extremely strong
OL,17,Fsenior executive team and clear
OL,18,Fdirection so that we can fulfil our
OL,19,Fpotential as the UK's first super-
OL,20,Funiversity."
OL,26,@qD@AOUwD@AOU|D@LO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/7
