OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785847716
OL,3,CUniversities of Kent and Greenwich
OL,4,Cmerge to create 'super-university'
OL,6,FA Department for Education
OL,7,Fspokesperson said: "We welcome this
OL,8,Fmerger, which will create a strong
OL,9,Fcombined institution able to reinvest
OL,10,Fin students and support the economy of
OL,11,Fthe south east.
OL,13,F"We are committed to creating a secure
OL,14,Ffuture for our world-leading
OL,15,Funiversities so they can deliver for
OL,16,Fstudents, taxpayers, workers and the
OL,17,Feconomy, and we expect universities to
OL,18,Ftake appropriate decisions to ensure
OL,19,Ftheir long-term sustainability.
OL,26,@oD@TOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
