OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785847716
OL,3,CUniversities of Kent and Greenwich
OL,4,Cmerge to create 'super-university'
OL,6,F"We have already taken action to put
OL,7,Funiversities on a firmer financial
OL,8,Ffooting, including by refocusing the
OL,9,FOffice for Students on monitoring the
OL,10,Ffinancial health of the sector."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@`O]
